### Obtener todas las asignaciones activas (sin filtros) — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getActiveAssignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### Asignaciones activas filtradas por rango de fechas — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getActiveAssignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-01-01T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-01-31T23:59:59"
}

### Asignaciones activas filtradas por organización y unidad — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getActiveAssignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": 1,
  "divisionId": 10,
  "subdivisionId": 100,
  "unitId": 5001
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getActiveAssignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### Body nulo → 400 (payload requerido)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getActiveAssignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

null
